# rt_migrate — symbol-driven rewrite of direct `rt_*(...)` call sites to their
# typed std aliases, driven by scripts/check/rt_alias_map.sdn.
#
# Modules:
#   alias_map.spl  — parse the .sdn map into AliasEntry records
#   rewrite.spl    — pure text transformation (no I/O), unit-tested in
#                    test/01_unit/app/tools/rt_migrate_spec.spl
#   main.spl       — CLI driver: `bin/simple run src/app/tools/rt_migrate/main.spl`
